onds between soft timeout and hard timeout (SIGKILL) |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:359:+| `--heartbeat` | `15` | Seconds between heartbeat events emitted to stderr |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:364: | `--output` | (none) | Path for Codex to write results (passed to `-o`) |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:367:-| `--json` | false | Emit dispatch result as JSON on stdout (mutually exclusive with `--async`) |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:368:-| `--async` | false | Return immediately with dispatch ID (mutually exclusive with `--json`) |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:369:+| `--json` | false | Emit dispatch result as JSON on stdout |\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:381: - **Linux**: Uses `PR_SET_PDEATHSIG` to arrange SIGKILL on parent death\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:383:-In async mode, parent-death detection is disabled so the dispatcher survives the caller exiting.\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:407:-    DispatchErrorInfo, DispatchResult, DispatchSpec, DispatchStatus, LiveStatus,\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:422:-    darkfactory-dispatch --async --prompt \\\"Refactor auth module\\\" --timeout 1800\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:423:-    darkfactory-dispatch status <dispatch-id>\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:424:-    darkfactory-dispatch wait <dispatch-id>\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:425:-    darkfactory-dispatch result <dispatch-id>\nopenspec/changes/dispatch-sync-only/mission/validations/mission-diff.patch:429:     {\\\"sta